[12.538798, "o", "I saved two Rust preferences to `BRAIN/prefs/rust.md`: use edition 2021, and ask before adding a dependency.\r\n\r\nThe `prefs/` folder and `rust.md` didn't exist, so I created both. I set `markers: Cargo.toml`, so the file only loads in Rust projects.\r\n"]
