[22.635438, "o", "I saved \"write git commit messages in the imperative mood\" (with an example) to a new file, `BRAIN/prefs/general.md`. It has no `markers:` line, so it loads in every project.\r\n"]
[22.693215, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[24.729325, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 2. Register tools: a repo, written notes, and an expert session.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
