[53.340695, "o", "I registered a notes tool, `naming`, in `brain/tools/naming.md`. I treated your text as written steps rather than a repo or a session.\r\n\r\nThe `description` line is:\r\n\r\n> Rules for naming a new project: a colour and an animal joined by a hyphen, like teal-otter. Use whenever a project needs a name.\r\n\r\nIs that right? Two details are my own additions: I made the name lowercase, and I added a step to pick a different pair if the name is already taken. Tell me if you want either changed or removed.\r\n"]
