[68.735697, "o", "I wrote the entry to `brain/tools/reviewer.md` as an expert tool. Is this `description` line right?\r\n\r\n> Code-review expert session. Send it a diff and what the change is for; it replies with findings. Reach for it to get a second review of a change before committing or opening a PR.\r\n\r\nI left out `path:` because you didn't say which folder the reviewer session runs in. If you tell me, I'll add it.\r\n"]
[68.788213, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[70.842775, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 3. See what the brain holds now.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
